# COMMERONIX - CLOUDFLARE PAGES & STATIC HOSTING ROUTING
#
# Cloudflare Pages natively serves clean URLs for all static HTML files:
# - Requests to /reading-time-calculator automatically serve reading-time-calculator.html (HTTP 200 OK)
# - Requests to /reading-time-calculator.html automatically canonical-redirect to /reading-time-calculator (HTTP 308)
# - Requests to /blog automatically serve /blog/index.html (HTTP 200 OK)
# - Requests to /blog/<article> automatically serve /blog/<article>.html (HTTP 200 OK)
# - Missing routes automatically serve /404.html (HTTP 404 Not Found)
#
# NOTE: Do NOT define manual '200' rewrites (e.g., /tool /tool.html 200) alongside
# '301!' redirects, as Cloudflare Pages will execute both simultaneously and cause
# an infinite ERR_TOO_MANY_REDIRECTS loop between the clean URL and .html extension.
# ==============================================================================
